      "name": "[Blueprint] High-Grade Blade of the Other: Block",
      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for this item. Obtained through investigations.\n\nItem Effect: When equipped, this item grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Perfect Block Enhancement]\nEnhancement I: When Powerful Slash hits a normal/elite/boss enemy, it reduces squad Corruption by <color=#2BAD00>10%/30%/60%</color> and restores <color=#2BAD00>5%/7.5%/10%</color> HP to all squad members, respectively.\n\nEnhancement II: Perfect Block triggers a Dodge even if the block fails.",
